{% doc %}
@param {object} customer - Shopify customer receiving the blocker notice
@param {object} contact - Billing contact role and preference data
@param {object} company - Client company workspace data
@param {object} billing - Billing cycle and cadence metadata
@param {object} blocker - Billing blocker item
@param {object} links - Signed links for portal actions
{% enddoc %}

{% assign locale = contact.locale | default: 'en' %}
{% assign company_name = company.name | default: customer.name | default: 'your team' %}

{% if locale == 'fr' %}
Bonjour {{ contact.name | default: customer.first_name | default: '!' | escape }},

Un item bloque la facturation de {{ company_name | escape }}.

Cycle: {{ billing.cycle_label | default: billing.title | default: 'cycle facturation' | escape }}
Blocage: {{ blocker.title | default: 'Action requise' | escape }}
Exigence: {{ blocker.requirement | default: 'A confirmer' | escape }}
Action: {{ blocker.action | default: 'Reviser dans le portail' | escape }}

Debloquer la facturation:
{{ links.billing_url | default: links.portal_url }}

Merci,
Philippe
{% else %}
Hi {{ contact.name | default: customer.first_name | default: 'there' | escape }},

One item is blocking billing for {{ company_name | escape }}.

Cycle: {{ billing.cycle_label | default: billing.title | default: 'billing run' | escape }}
Blocker: {{ blocker.title | default: 'Action needed' | escape }}
Requirement: {{ blocker.requirement | default: 'To confirm' | escape }}
Action: {{ blocker.action | default: 'Review in the portal' | escape }}

Unblock billing:
{{ links.billing_url | default: links.portal_url }}

Thanks,
Philippe
{% endif %}
